{"title":"2013 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 1c","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>State the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-intercept and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-intercept of the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/d/f2db05662c2b1633824ce8a8f8c607c0aa716403.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{3} + \\frac{y}{10} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"94\" height=\"34\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-intercept of a line is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> value when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/0/7a06334068417b1781d14e8b28af827907961eb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />, while the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-intercept of a line is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d348bde3e15456e71734dc2c56fc7425c95927f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/0/7a06334068417b1781d14e8b28af827907961eb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> to find the x-intercept, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f0e534bfd5c425d0b21042777345439e132baba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x_{int}}{3} + \\frac{0}{10} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"113\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/4/26452b27a24d094c2805eacf6e5ac910f399ef5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x_{int}}{3} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"68\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/b/b9be01545063f5d462cb43232c8c223f2604eb0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{int} = 1 \\times 3 = \\boxed{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"140\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>Next, we can plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d348bde3e15456e71734dc2c56fc7425c95927f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> to find the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-intercept. We get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/0/fb061ba36aa607aa3bcda103ea9e7b9698db0f7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{0}{3} + \\frac{y_{int}}{10} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/7/68780e686e41ca170d76cf24c993f108686f6ac5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{y_{int}}{10} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"67\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/a/c6a512768535e6b8c973db5ca572108ce625cab6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_{int} = 1 \\times 10 = \\boxed{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"157\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017232516\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 70/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3307/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.830      1 2013_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    5.830      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35636:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017232516 and revision id 278086. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}